:: NPC view - withdraw evening class
/* "Withdraw from evening class" button for enrolled students, shared by NPC view (slaves) and NPC view - guest.
   Skill points already earned are kept; any remaining advanced study (teachAdvStudy) resumes if they re-enroll. */
<<if setup.eveningSchool.isEnrolled($tmpGirl)>>
	<<link `'Withdraw from evening class (' + $tmpGirl.teach + ')'`>>
		<<run delete $tmpGirl.teach>>
		<<goto `passage()`>>
	<</link>>
<</if>>
